<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/30/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Deletion of sections 62, 63 and 64"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/30/eng@> .
