<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/30/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Central Bank of Malaysia Act 2009 [Act 701], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended by deleting sections 62, 63 and 64. New section 66a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/30/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/30/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/30/eng@> .
