<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/30/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 76 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “Unless otherwise provided in this Act” the words “or any other written law”."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/30/eng@> .
